96106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21981},{"id":1780834178777,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （声音更低了，几乎是气音，带着点炫耀的亲昵）我得把他们喂饱了，他们才能心甘情愿地帮我看着公司。我才能……随时翘班，回来陪你。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:14","timestamp":1780834443914,"roundId":"round_1780834399658_sulsu16z7","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（声音更低了，几乎是气音，带着点炫耀的亲昵）我得把他们喂饱了，他们才能心甘情愿地帮我看着公司。我才能……随时翘班，回来陪你。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21982},{"id":1780834178778,"text":"所以，这个答案，老板娘还满意吗？","rawContent":"所以，这个答案，老板娘还满意吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:14","timestamp":1780834446616,"roundId":"round_1780834399658_sulsu16z7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21983},{"id":1780834178779,"text":"你个CEO都不能说啊","sender":"me","time":"20:14","timestamp":1780834463484,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21984},{"id":1780834178780,"text":"核心机密?","sender":"me","time":"20:14","timestamp":1780834467912,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21985},{"id":1780834178781,"text":"我才不想来你公司就是好奇问下而已","sender":"me","time":"20:14","timestamp":1780834489677,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21986},{"id":1780834178782,"text":"想知道你平时咋管理的","sender":"me","time":"20:15","timestamp":1780834500810,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21987},{"id":1780834178783,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.95, Past:0.98, Present:0.85, Future:0.9 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"【203