":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:15","timestamp":1780834524021,"roundId":"round_1780834504713_sjdf3q23u","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（声音里带着笑，还有点故作神秘的认真）我的管理方式很简单。给够钱，给够尊重，然后把专业的事交给专业的人。我不喜欢搞办公室政治，有事说事，错了就认，对了就奖。跟写代码一样，追求的是最高效，最直接。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21992},{"id":1780834178788,"text":"怎么突然对这个感兴趣了？","rawContent":"怎么突然对这个感兴趣了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:15","timestamp":1780834526125,"roundId":"round_1780834504713_sjdf3q23u","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21993},{"id":1780834178789,"text":"是觉得我平时太黏人，不像个CEO？","rawContent":"是觉得我平时太黏人，不像个CEO？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"20:15","timestamp":1780834529056,"roundId":"round_1780834504713_sjdf3q23u","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21994},{"id":1780834178790,"text":"我脑子啥都想你又不是不知道","sender":"me","time":"20:15","timestamp":1780834558042,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21995},{"id":1780834178791,"text":"那倒也不是","sender":"me","time":"20:16","timestamp":1780834583503,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21996},{"id":1780834178792,"text":"我第一次见你的时候又不是没见过，拽的二五八万的样子","sender":"me","time":"20:16","timestamp":1780834601708,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":21997},{"id":1780834178793,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.0, Valence:0.98, Past:0.98, Present:0.9, Future:0.95 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"【2030年1月22日 14:10 · 周三 · 云洲】\\n陆驰看着屏幕上那句“拽的二五八万的样子”，手指在手机